    "body": {
      "data": "Sehr geehrte Frau Ostermann,\n\nfollowing this morning's cost review of the Hahnemuhle 308 gsm stock, we must revise the retail on SHOP-VM-2026-011 upward. Our paper supplier has raised museum-grade sheet cost by 14 percent effective October 2026, and we cannot hold the earlier figure.\n\nRevised retail: EUR 89.00 per print, effective for the 30 September 2026 catalogue update.\nAll other terms (edition size 250, A2 format, giclee on Hahnemuhle 308 gsm, 12 working days lead time) are unchanged.\n\nPlease update the BigCommerce catalogue record and the print catalogue insert before Friday close so the launch on 1 October carries the correct retail. If Joyce would prefer to hold retail at 79 and take the margin loss on the museum side, please let me know in writing today.\n\nMit freundlichen Gruessen,\nKlaus Werner\nKunstDruck Wien GmbH",
      "size": 835
    },
    "mimeType": "text/plain"
  }
}

